PORTED FROM BLENDER

Some behaviour in Husk is ported from Blender (https://www.blender.org),
Copyright Blender Authors, licensed under GPL-2.0-or-later. Each ported piece
is marked in its source file:

husk_core/src/render/renderer.rs
  pan_offset: from viewmove_apply (view3d_navigate.cc), ED_view3d_win_to_delta
    (view3d_project.cc) and ED_view3d_calc_zfac.
  orthographic_after_rotating: from ED_view3d_persp_ensure (view3d_utils.cc).
  radius_to_dist: from ED_view3d_radius_to_dist (view3d_utils.cc).
  frame_bounds: from view3d_from_minmax (view3d_navigate_view_all.cc).
  The test that checks the six standard views uses the rotations from
      view3d_quat_axis (view3d_utils.cc).

husk_core/src/scene/mode.rs
  ObjectMode: from eObjectMode (DNA_object_enums.h).
  mode_compat_test: from mode_compat_test (object_modes.cc).
  set: from the checks in mode_set_ex and mode_compat_set (object_modes.cc).


husk_core/src/rig/paint.rs
  blend_weight: from ED_wpaint_blend_tool, wval_blend, wval_add and wval_sub
    (paint_vertex_weight_utils.cc).
  normalize_with_lock: from BKE_defvert_normalize_ex (deform.cc).
  paint_vertex: the blend, clamp and normalize order of gradientVert_update and
    paint_weight_gradient_exec (paint_vertex_weight_ops.cc).


husk_core/src/rig/brush.rs
  Stroke: from the weight paint stroke code (do_wpaint_brush_draw,
    do_weight_paint_vertex_single, wpaint_blend, wpaint_clamp_monotonic).
  falloff: from BKE_brush_curve_strength (brush.cc), the Smooth preset.
  Stroke::smooth: from do_wpaint_brush_blur and precompute_weight_values.
  husk_core/src/rig/adjacency.rs
  Adjacency::corners: the faces-around-a-vertex neighbourhood that
    do_wpaint_brush_blur averages over.
husk_core/src/rig/dual_quat.rs
  DualQuat::from_matrix: from mat4_to_dquat. DualQuat::blend: from
    add_weighted_dq_dq and normalize_dq, with the total weight rule of
    armature_deform. DualQuat::transform_point: from mul_v3m3_dq (BLI
    math_rotation). The dual quaternion routines there are from the University
    of Dublin, Trinity College (Zlib licence, Copyright 2006-2007 University of
    Dublin, Trinity College, All Rights Reserved).
husk_core/src/render/shader.wgsl
  dual_quat_skin: the same blend as dual_quat.rs, on the GPU.
  weight_to_rgb: from BKE_defvert_weight_to_rgb (deform.cc).


